# Build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT, not the workspace.
#
# The previous copy of this file sat one level up and excluded `app/venv/`,
# `Private-Local/`, `Evidence/` and other siblings. Those paths do not exist
# from here, and a stale exclude is worse than a missing one: it looks like the
# thing is handled. Every entry below is relative to this directory.

# The interpreter and third-party packages. By far the largest thing in the
# tree, and reinstalled from requirements.txt inside the image anyway.
venv/

# Owner data. `models/` is a bind mount at runtime and weights must never be
# baked into a layer; `outputs/` is generated work.
models/
outputs/
tmp/

# The upstream Neo container definition. It builds a DIFFERENT product -- it
# clones sd-webui-forge-classic from GitHub and runs the Gradio WebUI -- and is
# not part of this image. Kept in the repository as inherited upstream source;
# see deploy/README.md.
docker/

.git/
.github/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
*.zip

# Local launcher state. `config.json` is Neo's; the container writes its own
# config into /studio/config from deploy/entrypoint.py.
params.txt
